#: src/Plugin.php:86
msgid "Our forms use WP Antispam for local spam protection. It checks random signed form tokens and an empty hidden field. No data is sent to an external spam service. WP Antispam does not store IP addresses, email addresses, form content, user agents, cookies or browser fingerprints. One-time token digests remain until expiry (two hours) and scheduled cleanup; cleanup can be delayed by site traffic or cron configuration. Anonymous daily counters are retained for the period configured by the site administrator (30 days by default). Form providers, WordPress and hosting may process submission data independently. Adapt this notice to your actual settings and privacy policy."
msgstr ""

